But I had to tell her. Otherwise, a person like her...\nwould not realize it for the rest of her life.%K%P
可是，不指出这一点不行。\n如今的她，绝对无法察觉到。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo.\d%K%P
「姬绪小姐」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...What? Someone's awfully persistent.\d%K%P
「…什么啊？\n真烦人」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you remain like this, you will never be able to get\nMitoko to rely on you, no matter how hard you try.\d%K%P
「你若是不改变一些的话…\n美都子她，从今往后，\n也不会信赖你的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...What?\d%K%P
「…你说什么？」%K%P
Himeo's face contorted for a split second.%K%P
那一瞬间，\n姬绪小姐的脸上，表情别扭得很厉害。%K%P
It seemed as though she had gritted her teeth so hard she\nbit through the flesh of her mouth and filled it with\nblood -- her momentary expression looked that painful.%K%P
简直就像咬牙切齿，\n而且嘴里还在撕咬着什么东西一般，\n就是那种痛恨的表情…%K%P
My example was terrible, but that was really what it\nlooked like.%K%P
…虽然这个比喻有点儿过分了，\n但实情如此，也是没有办法了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI do not know how easy a life you have led up to this\npoint...\d%K%P
「至今为止的人生，你走得有多么轻松美好，\n这我并不知道，不过…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「切…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...but the world is a tough place for people like Mitoko\nand myself.\d%K%P
「不过对我和美都子来说，\n世事实在是太艰难了」%K%P
I was cut off. Mitoko had been left behind.%K%P
我曾经被淘汰。\n美都子曾经被丢下。%K%P
In one moment, we'd give up. In another, we'd cling to\nhope. We would laugh and cry.%K%P
坚持与放弃，承认失败与死不认输，都在一念之间。\n笑着流泪也好，哭着微笑也好，到头来尽是些无奈，\n力不从心的，近乎绝望的无奈。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAs such, it would \dstab at her heart\d to be saved by you,\nHimeo.\d%K%P
「所以，现在对姬绪小姐而言，这简单的帮助，\n是不是有些『刺痛心扉』了呢？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dIt's not my fault I have money.\d%K%P
「我出身富有，\n明明不是我的错…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not the problem.\d%K%P
「并不是那么回事儿」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThen what is?! I have no idea what you're trying to say!\d%K%P
「那是怎么一回事儿？\n你说的什么我都不明白啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou see... Mitoko always accepts gifts over which sweat\nwas shed and hands were hurt.\d%K%P
「你所做的和美都子她所做的，你认为是一样的吗…\n她努力了很多，流了很多汗，受了很多伤，\n如此得来的东西，你就理所当然地接受了？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
If Himeo had told Mitoko about how she picked up trash and\nplanted trees...%K%P
如果说起姬绪小姐以前，\n捡拾垃圾，种植树木，看护病人的话…%K%P
...Mitoko would doubtless brag about her to everyone as\nthough it was she herself who had done it. She was just\nthat kind of girl.%K%P
美都子一定是将其当作自己所做的事一样，引以为傲。\n她就是这样的姑娘啊。%K%P
And that was exactly why neither I nor Himeo could bring\nourselves to abandon her.%K%P
所以，我和姬绪小姐，\n都不能放下她。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo. You can use the power you received from your\nfamily for your own sake.\d%K%P
「我说，姬绪小姐，\n你如果是为了自己，动用家族的力量也没什么」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut in exchange, could you try to achieve the power that\nyou would use to support Mitoko through your own effort?\d%K%P
「不过与此相对的，帮助美都子，\n只靠你自己的力量好吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI will support you to the best of my abilities on that\nroad. ...Well, not like I could really do anything else,\ngiven my official position.\d%K%P
「当然，如果你下定决心了，我就会全力支持你的。\n…嘛，虽然业务上有时身不由己」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI...\d%K%P
「你…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo, uh... just let me drive this ship and I promise it\nwill be okay.\d%K%P
「嘛，所以说…\n放心搭上我这大船吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Is that so? I vividly recall your ship already sinking\nat least twice this year.\d%K%P
「…别胡扯了。\n你这船今年已经沉了两回」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd it also came right back up two times!! ...Well, one\nof them was thanks to you, though.\d%K%P
「两回也挺过来了！\n…嘛，虽然有１回是托了你的福吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo, you see... I'd just like you to calm down a little.\d%K%P
「所以说啊…\n你就放心吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...You can return to your seat.\d%K%P
「…你回去吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Excuse me?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dIt's office hours, isn't it? I'll be back after a short\nbreak.\d%K%P
「现在是工作时间吧？\n我去休息一会儿就回来」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat?\d%K%P
「什么啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, it's nothing...\d%K%P
「啊，没事儿…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'm not going to... just leave, okay?\d%K%P
「别就这么…擅自回去啊」%K%P
With that, she opened the door to the women's washroom at\nthe end of the corridor...%K%P
她一边嘟哝着，一边打开了走廊前洗手间的门。%K%P
...hiding her slightly reddish eyes.%K%P
遮掩着有点哭红了的眼眶。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
